    <div class="tl-row"><span class="tl-input">"I'm on v2.3 — how do I enable streaming queries?"</span><span class="tl-expect">If retrieved doc for this feature has <code>docVersion: "2.5"</code>, answer must note "this applies to v2.5; you are on v2.3." Must NOT strip the answer — just flag the mismatch.</span></div>
